---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About — Haitao Zheng"
  description="Haitao Zheng: Cyber Security & Privacy student at H-BRS, open-source contributor and builder of security tools in Germany."
>
  <div class="shell page-content">
    <header class="page-header">
      <span class="eyebrow">
        About / <span lang="zh">郑海涛</span>
      </span>
      <h1>
        A student.
        <br />A working practice.
      </h1>
      <p>
        I’m Haitao, also known as Tao. I study cyber security in Germany and
        learn by building tools, reading existing systems and contributing
        changes upstream.
      </p>
    </header>
    <div class="profile-grid">
      <aside class="profile-aside">
        <img
          src="/portrait-small.webp"
          alt="Haitao Zheng"
          width="480"
          height="600"
          loading="lazy"
        />
        <p class="note">Germany / English · German · Mandarin</p>
        <a class="text-link" href="https://github.com/0xTaoZ">
          GitHub / 0xTaoZ ↗
        </a>
      </aside>
      <div class="profile-copy">
        <h2>Security meets infrastructure.</h2>
        <p>
          I am interested in the places where those fields overlap:
          authentication boundaries, cloud configuration, useful audit evidence
          and the tools people use to investigate problems.
        </p>
        <p>
          My accepted upstream work includes SSH behavior in pyinfra,
          CloudFormation validation in cfn-lint, and security checks in Prowler.
          My own projects let me make the product and implementation decisions
          together.
        </p>
        <p>
          I’m early in my career. The code, tests, reviews and case studies on
          this site show the work I can already do and the areas I’m developing
          next.
        </p>
        <a class="text-link" href="mailto:h@tzheng.dev">
          Talk about an opportunity <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
        </a>
        <section class="timeline" id="education">
          <span class="eyebrow">Education & foundations</span>
          <div class="timeline-item">
            <span class="meta">October 2025 – Present / Germany</span>
            <h3>Hochschule Bonn-Rhein-Sieg</h3>
            <p>
              B.Sc. Cyber Security & Privacy. Programming, systems, networking,
              mathematics and privacy form the foundation underneath my project
              work.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="timeline-item">
            <span class="meta">December 2024 – June 2025 / Bielefeld</span>
            <h3>FHM / University preparation</h3>
            <p>
              Completed the university preparatory pathway and
              Feststellungsprüfung. Developed academic German to C1 during the
              transition to studying in Germany.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="timeline-item">
            <span class="meta">2024 / Online coursework</span>
            <h3>CS50x / Computer science foundations</h3>
            <p>
              Completed the CS50x course: algorithms, data structures, C,
              Python, SQL and a final programming project.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="timeline-item">
            <span class="meta">2021 – 2024 / Xiamen, China</span>
            <h3>Jimei Middle School</h3>
            <p>Completed secondary education before moving to Germany.</p>
          </div>
        </section>
        <section class="timeline" id="toolkit">
          <span class="eyebrow">Tools in context</span>
          <div class="timeline-item">
            <h3>Python & Linux</h3>
            <p>
              Local log tools, parsing and upstream infrastructure fixes. See{" "}
              <a href="/projects/cloudtrail-quickscan/">CloudTrail Quickscan</a>{" "}
              and the <a href="/contributions/">contribution record</a>.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="timeline-item">
            <h3>TypeScript & web systems</h3>
            <p>
              React, Worker APIs, typed domain rules and SQL persistence in{" "}
              <a href="/projects/studypulse/">StudyPulse</a>. Astro and static
              publishing for this site.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="timeline-item">
            <h3>Java, C & SQL</h3>
            <p>
              Coursework and focused tools:{" "}
              <a href="/projects/java-web-log-triage/">
                Java access-log review
              </a>
              , <a href="/projects/socket-state-triage/">C socket inspection</a>{" "}
              and database-backed application work.
            </p>
          </div>
        </section>
        <section class="timeline">
          <span class="eyebrow">Beyond the keyboard</span>
          <p>
            I photograph portraits, everyday life and landscapes with a Nikon
            D750. Cycling, strength training and team sports give me another way
            to stay curious and consistent.
          </p>
          <p>
            I work in English and German, speak Mandarin and Hokkien, and have
            basic Japanese.
          </p>
        </section>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
